[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 17830.788, "timestamp": "04:57:10", "text": "你可以封禁角色。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17832.55, "timestamp": "04:57:12", "text": "是的，可以。就像某种"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17834.15, "timestamp": "04:57:14", "text": "等级，你必须喜欢你可以封禁。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17836.59, "timestamp": "04:57:16", "text": "人物。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17839.11, "timestamp": "04:57:19", "text": "哇。哦，你在打排位赛啊。那是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17848.07, "timestamp": "04:57:28", "text": "该死。这是上一局游戏里的那个人吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17849.83, "timestamp": "04:57:29", "text": "某物？我不是那种会默默无闻的人。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17853.59, "timestamp": "04:57:33", "text": "悄然融入背景。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17855.27, "timestamp": "04:57:35", "text": "你知道吗？我必须让他看到我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17858.628, "timestamp": "04:57:38", "text": "我得给他看点什么吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17864.788, "timestamp": "04:57:44", "text": "太棒了。如果你知道这是什么"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17867.27, "timestamp": "04:57:47", "text": "动态图像的意思就是像这样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17874.788, "timestamp": "04:57:54", "text": "如果那个人，嗯，如果那个人有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17877.03, "timestamp": "04:57:57", "text": "我在这款游戏上花费了差不多几个小时。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17879.35, "timestamp": "04:57:59", "text": "很喜欢那种氛围"}]